+------------------------------------------------------------
-- @DESC: parenthesised ternary expression selector (E6)
------------------------------------------------------------+
rule main:
  new score := 12;
  new ok := (100 if score > 10 else 5);
  expect ok = 100;
  new nok := (100 if score < 10 else 5);
  expect nok = 5;
  new msg := ("big" if score ≥ 10 else "small");
  expect msg = "big";
return;
+------------------------------------------------------------
spec/02-statements.md §3.2: the parenthesised conditional
selector `( expr_true if condition else expr_false )` evaluates
the condition and yields only the chosen branch; the untaken
branch is never evaluated. Covers numeric and string operands.
------------------------------------------------------------+
-- @AI: No - assertion-only (self-verifying)
